      "label": "sarcasm expression",
      "description": "Denzel Washington's subtle, knowing expression, combined with the ironic message about vocalness equating to weakness, conveys a tone of sarcasm. His slight smirk and direct gaze suggest he is mocking or ridiculing the idea that being loud is a sign of weakness.",
